From 6edc7c3da3ca8bec3fcf813e6a3d7d707c24a3a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PocketForge Worker <worker@pocketforge.invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:48:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/input: route A133 controls through gamepad MCU UARTs

Replace the synthetic virtio-input transport with the release hardware path:
bounded gamepad-MCU frame sources feeding the existing UART3 and UART4 RX
FIFOs. Negotiate input ABI 2.0 for per-UART ordering and readiness, and expose
only the exact digital and hat codes implemented by this revision.

Assisted-by: LLM
